  },
  {
    "id": 1002004040150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ほっとしたらお腹が空いてしまいました",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100200404/1002004040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははっ！\r\nそうだな、何か食べるか！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織は何が食べたい？\r\n今から食べに出ると、帰り遅くなっちゃうかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004040160,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あ、私が作りますよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200404/1002004040160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004040170,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサー、食べたいものありますか？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200404/1002004040170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ！　いやいや、結構作ってもらうこと多いし\r\n毎回はさすがに悪いよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004040180,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "小学生の時からずっとやってることですし、\r\n今さら料理を手間だとか、面倒だなんて思いませんよ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200404/1002004040180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "しかしなぁ……\r\nしょっちゅう何か作ってもらって申し訳ないというか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004040190,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ええ……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200404/1002004040190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004040200,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "強要されているならまだしも……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200404/1002004040200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004040210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私がやりたくてやってることですし\r\n問題ないと思いますが……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200404/1002004040210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004040220,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "食べたいものが外食でしか食べられない\r\nとかじゃなければ、作らせてください",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200404/1002004040220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004040230,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私、料理するの──────",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200404/1002004040230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004040240,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "…………………………",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200404/1002004040240"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……灯織？　どうした？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004040250,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あ…………いえ、すみません\r\nなんでもありません",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200404/1002004040250"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004040260,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "えっと……その……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200404/1002004040260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002004040270,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "何が作れそうか、ちょっと冷蔵庫見てきますね……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200404/1002004040270"
  },
